  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Planets X and Y move in circular orbits around the same star.</p>\n<p>The orbital period of planet Y is twice the orbital period of planet X. The orbital radius of planet X is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the orbital radius of planet Y?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt[3]{2}R\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt[3]{4}R\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2R\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4R\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
